* 08-bjt-darlington.lib - Darlington built from a stage subcircuit defined later in the file
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.subckt DARLINGTON_NPN C B E
X1 C B M NPN_STAGE
X2 C M E NPN_STAGE
RBE M E 8k
.ends DARLINGTON_NPN
*
.subckt NPN_STAGE c b e
Q1 c b e 0 NPN_DRV 1.0      ; four-terminal form: substrate node, then area
.ends NPN_STAGE
.model NPN_DRV NPN(IS=20f BF=150 VAF=80 RB=5 RC=0.5 RE=0.2)
